      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Yeah, if you are okay draining write tasks,\n\nNo, I\u0027m not OK. It is better to defer writes as much as possible.\n\nI also do not want to make delete immediate. I just aying it is possible to make it immediate, since \"draining write tasks\" already happening anyway (in the `removeFromHotCache()`).\n\nI only ask to remove tracking of the delete task from `mDeferredTasks`. This way no need to allocate dummy buffer. There is just no point to track that task (or maybe I do not see one?).",
      "parentUuid": "728dd000_3cbeee01",
      "revId": "694bfc703e12caf62b348924c4c45f742ec66db6",
